<title>UK: Goldmans no comment on placing Guinness.</title>
<headline>Goldmans no comment on placing Guinness.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. investment bank Goldman Sachs declined comment on market reports that it was placing approximately 135 million shares in Guinness Plc on behalf of LVMH.</p>
<p>&quot;It looks like LVMH is reducing its holding in Guinness from around 21 percent to 15 percent,&quot; the head of sales and trading at a large brokerage said.</p>
<p>Guinness had no immediate comment, either. -- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
